<title>UK: Porterbrook makes 210 mln stg on Stagecoach shares.</title>
<headline>Porterbrook makes 210 mln stg on Stagecoach shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Ltd said on Friday that more than 28 million shares in Stagecoach Holdings Plc had been placed on behalf of former shareholders of Porterbrook Leasing Company MEBO Ltd for a total of 210 million stg.</p>
<p>The shares have been placed on behalf of former shareholders of Porterbrook, including funds managed by Chaterhouse Development Capital Ltd and associated co-investors.</p>
</text>
